<!--
============================================================================
 overview.html · 抖音博主深度拆解报告模板（v0.3.1）
============================================================================

这是一份**完整可运行的骨架**——直接复制一份到 reports/<run_id>/overview.html，
然后按照下面三个规则填内容：

  1. `{{...}}` 占位符 → 用 profile.json / 转录素材的具体值替换。
     大数（粉丝 / 获赞）走"万 / 亿"展示规则：例如 413000 → "41.3"，单位 → "万"。
     字段 null 时数值位置显示 "—"，单位留空。

  2. `<!-- TODO(章节): ... -->` 注释 → 这里必须写实际拆解内容，
     注释里列出了"该写什么"，但**不要照搬注释里的措辞**——它只是指引，
     不是文案。写完后请删掉这条 TODO 注释。

  3. 每个 `<section>` 末尾的 `qa-card · 必须答的问题` **必须答完 5 个问题**，
     这是深度的硬底线。问题清单写在 SKILL.md 各章节里，按章对照填入。

填完后做两件事：
  · Step 4：base64 内嵌图片（含 avatar.jpg + 各 aweme/N.jpg）
  · 生成 index.json（强制 schema 见 SKILL.md §3.8）

**不要**改 head 里的 CSS / Tailwind config / 字体；改了视觉一致性就垮。
**不要**加 `<header>` sticky 顶栏 / `<footer>` 脚注；这两块在 SKILL §3.5 / §3.6
明确禁止。
============================================================================
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{display_name}} · 博主拆解分析报告</title>

  <!-- 字体：阿里巴巴普惠体 3（chinese-fonts-cdn，自动 subset + woff2） + JetBrains Mono（代码 / 数字） -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev/packages/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3/dist/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular/result.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev/packages/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3/dist/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium/result.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev/packages/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3/dist/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold/result.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* 把 chinese-fonts-cdn 的三个 package 别名到统一的 "Alibaba PuHuiTi" 家族，
       通过 font-weight 自动选权重。`local()` 命中已注册的 webfont 家族，
       不会触发额外的网络请求。 */
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 55 Regular');
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 65 Medium');
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 600;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 65 Medium');
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 85 Bold');
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Tailwind CDN with Weelume brand config -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            ink: '#F5F5F7',
            'ink-soft': '#D4D4D8',
            muted: '#8A8A94',
            canvas: '#050507',
            surface: '#0D0D12',
            'surface-2': '#141420',
            hairline: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)',
            'hairline-strong': 'rgba(255,255,255,0.16)',
            accent: '#A78BFA',
            'accent-2': '#22D3EE',
            'accent-3': '#F472B6',
            report: '#10b981',
            'report-deep': '#064e3b',
            'report-soft': 'rgba(16,185,129,0.08)',
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['"Alibaba PuHuiTi"', '"AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular"', '"PingFang SC"', '"Microsoft YaHei"', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],
            serif: ['"Alibaba PuHuiTi"', '"AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold"', '"PingFang SC"', '"Microsoft YaHei"', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['"JetBrains Mono"', 'ui-monospace', 'SFMono-Regular', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Consolas', 'monospace'],
          },
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    html { scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0; padding: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      background-color: #050507;
      color: #F5F5F7;
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-feature-settings: "palt";
      font-variant-numeric: lining-nums proportional-nums;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }
    body {
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(167,139,250,0.18), transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 0%, rgba(34,211,238,0.14), transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 110%, rgba(244,114,182,0.12), transparent 55%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-optical-sizing: auto;
      font-feature-settings: "palt";
    }
    /* 报告里的"中文衬线大字"位（h1/h2 + 一句话答卷 + stats 数字）
       原本走 Noto Serif SC，现在统一切到普惠体 Bold——保留 class 名兼容
       现存模板和已有报告，不改 markup。 */
    .font-serif-zh {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    ::selection { background-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.35); color: #fff; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      background-clip: padding-box;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background-clip: padding-box; }

    /* Hero 一句话答卷渐变文字 */
    .text-shimmer {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #F5F5F7 0%, #A78BFA 40%, #22D3EE 70%, #F5F5F7 100%);
      background-size: 200% 200%;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      animation: shimmerText 12s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes shimmerText {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 200% 50%; }
    }

    .glass {
      background: rgba(13,13,18,0.55);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(160%) blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(160%) blur(18px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .accent-bar { border-left: 3px solid #10b981; }
    .accent-bar-deep { border-left: 3px solid #064e3b; }
    .zh-justify { text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; }

    /* "必须答的问题" 答疑卡片 */
    .qa-card {
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
      background: rgba(16,185,129,0.05);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .qa-card-label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      color: #10b981;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    /* 表格 */
    table.report-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    table.report-table thead th {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #b8aa96;
      text-align: left;
    }
    table.report-table tbody td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
      vertical-align: top;
      color: #D4D4D8;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }
    table.report-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    /* 章节分割 */
    .chapter-divider {
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 1em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 3.5rem 0;
    }

    /* 引用块 */
    blockquote.report-quote {
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      color: #e7dfd4;
      font-size: 15.5px;
      line-height: 1.95;
    }
    blockquote.report-quote cite {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #10b981;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    /* 内联 cite（作品标题引用） */
    cite { font-style: normal; color: #34d399; font-weight: 500; }

    /* 框架角标 */
    .framework-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8A8A94;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    /* 正文段落 */
    .prose-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 2.05; color: #d6cfc4; }
    .prose-body p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .prose-body code {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      color: #10b981;
    }

    /* 小节标题 */
    .subhead {
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
      padding-left: 0.85rem;
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.4;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #fffdf7;
    }

    strong { color: #fffdf7; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <!-- 布局：xl+ 走 [16rem | 主内容] 双列；行内目录小屏使用，xl+ 由左侧 aside 接管。
       不允许在此外再加 <header> sticky 顶栏。-->
  <div class="xl:grid xl:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:gap-10 2xl:gap-14 mx-auto max-w-7xl">

  <!-- 左侧固定目录（xl+） -->
  <aside class="hidden xl:block xl:sticky xl:top-0 xl:self-start xl:max-h-screen xl:overflow-y-auto px-8 pt-16 pb-12">
    <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase text-muted mb-5">Table of Contents</p>
    <p class="font-serif-zh text-[15px] font-medium text-ink-soft mb-6">十四章目录</p>
    <ol class="space-y-2.5 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">01</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#profile">博主画像</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">02</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#audience">观众画像与心理任务</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">03</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#positioning">内容定位</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">04</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#style">作品风格</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">05</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#value">核心价值主张</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">06</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#topics">选题策略</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">07</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#scripts">文案与脚本</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">08</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#craft">制作品质</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">09</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#growth">算法适配</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">10</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#evolution">成长路线</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">11</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#monetization">变现路径</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">12</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#transferability">方法论可迁移性</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">13</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#risk">风险与天花板</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">14</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#takeaway">可借鉴清单</a></li>
    </ol>
  </aside>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-14 pb-24 xl:mx-0 xl:max-w-3xl xl:px-10">

    <!-- ====== HERO · 博主名片 + 一句话答卷 ====== -->
    <section id="summary" class="mb-16 pt-2">

      <!-- 博主名片 -->
      <!-- 头像选项（SKILL.md §3.3）：
           A. profile.json.avatar_path 非 null（默认场景）→ 用下面的 <img data-rk-frame="avatar.jpg">，
              Step 4 会替换成 src="data:<mime>;base64,..."。
           B. profile.json.avatar_path 为 null（collector 没抓到头像或下载失败）
              → 删掉 <img>，改用首字母占位 <div>：
              <!-- WARN: 头像本地化失败，使用首字母占位 -->
              <div class="h-24 w-24 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 rounded-full border border-white/15
                          bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0
                          font-serif-zh text-[34px] font-semibold text-ink-soft select-none">
                {{display_name 第一个字符}}
              </div>
           **绝对不允许** 把 profile.json.avatar_url（抖音 CDN URL）填到 src 里。 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-7 sm:gap-8 mb-10">
        <img
          data-rk-frame="avatar.jpg"
          alt="{{display_name}} 头像"
          class="h-24 w-24 sm:h-28 sm:w-28 rounded-full border border-white/15 object-cover shrink-0 shadow-[0_8px_32px_-12px_rgba(167,139,250,0.4)]"
        />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <h1 class="font-serif-zh text-[38px] sm:text-[46px] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink mb-2.5">
            {{display_name}}
          </h1>
          <p class="font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-soft mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5">
            <span>抖音号 <span class="text-report">{{douyin_id}}</span></span>
            <span class="text-white/15">·</span>
            <a
              href="{{home_url}}"
              target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-report hover:text-ink transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
            >访问主页<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </p>
          <p class="text-[14px] sm:text-[14.5px] leading-[1.9] tracking-[0.02em] text-ink-soft">
            {{description}}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats 矩阵 -->
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 border-y border-white/10 py-7 mb-12">
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-muted mb-1.5">Followers · 粉丝</dt>
          <dd class="font-serif-zh text-[26px] sm:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink leading-none">{{follower_count_value}}<span class="text-[14px] ml-1 text-ink-soft tracking-normal align-baseline">{{follower_count_unit}}</span></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-muted mb-1.5">Likes · 获赞</dt>
          <dd class="font-serif-zh text-[26px] sm:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink leading-none">{{liked_count_value}}<span class="text-[14px] ml-1 text-ink-soft tracking-normal align-baseline">{{liked_count_unit}}</span></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-muted mb-1.5">Works · 作品</dt>
          <dd class="font-serif-zh text-[26px] sm:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink leading-none">{{total_works_count}}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-muted mb-1.5">Following · 关注</dt>
          <dd class="font-serif-zh text-[26px] sm:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink leading-none">{{following_count}}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <!-- 一句话答卷 -->
      <div class="relative my-12 px-2 py-10 text-center">
        <span class="mx-auto mb-7 block h-px w-12 bg-report"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.45em] uppercase text-report mb-5">
          One-Sentence Verdict · 一句话答卷
        </p>
        <p class="font-serif-zh text-[22px] sm:text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.7] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <!-- TODO(一句话答卷):
            用一句话讲清核心招式，必须具体到动作。结构建议：
            ta 以"<招式1> + <招式2> + <招式3>"为招式，把"<人设/位置>"，
            钉在了一群<目标受众>的心智里。
            可以用 <span class="text-shimmer">关键短语</span> 包裹 2-3 个招式词获得渐变效果。
          -->
        </p>
        <span class="mx-auto mt-7 block h-px w-12 bg-report"></span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 行内目录（小屏使用；xl+ 由左侧固定边栏接管） -->
    <nav class="mb-16 border-t border-b border-white/10 py-8 xl:hidden">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-muted mb-4">
        Table of Contents · 十四章目录
      </p>
      <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-y-2 text-[14px] text-ink-soft">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-report w-6">01</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors" href="#profile">博主画像</a></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-report w-6">02</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors" href="#audience">观众画像与心理任务</a></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-report w-6">03</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors" href="#positioning">内容定位</a></li>
